WEBVTT

00:00:00.236 --> 00:00:03.387
Keep track of <b>who you buy</b> each thing from

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:12.002
Add your supplier with their phone number

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:14.850
Save, and it's in your directory

00:00:14.917 --> 00:00:23.141
On each product you choose who supplies it

00:00:23.276 --> 00:00:28.668
So when something runs out, you know who to call
